  "worked_solution": "The coordinates of the point are $(5,7).$\n\n- The real part of this complex number is $x=5,$ and\n\n- the imaginary part is $y=7.$\n\nTherefore, the number depicted is $z=5+7\\text{i}.$ Finally, notice that \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}z & =5+7\\text{i} \\\\  & =7\\text{i}+5.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
